Date: Wed, 12 Jun 2024 23:07:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Set Doge BIP66 activation heights

Maintenance explanation (added 2026-10-14; not original author text):
Set Dogecoin BIP66 activation heights so strict DER enforcement follows
the intended chain rather than inherited ABC activation settings.

The original subject, author and author date are preserved. Only message
metadata changes; exact source diff bytes and intermediate trees are retained.

